     3659                 run waitfram-hide in this-procedure .
     3660                 assign
     3661                 off-option = "":U
     3662                 .
     3663                 undo, return error.
     3664           end.
     3665             end.
     3666           end.
     3667           run waitfram-hide in this-procedure .
